# ==============================================================================
# LearnHub AI — Frontend Environment Variables Example
# ==============================================================================

# Backend REST API Base URL (You can use either VITE_API_URL or VITE_BACKEND_URL)
#
# 1. Unified Deployment on Render (Frontend served by Express):
#    VITE_API_URL=/api
#
# 2. Split Deployment (Frontend on Vercel / Netlify / Local, Backend on Render):
#    VITE_API_URL=https://learnhub-ai-1.onrender.com/api
#    (or VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://learnhub-ai-1.onrender.com)
#
# 3. Local Development:
#    VITE_API_URL=/api
#
VITE_API_URL=https://learnhub-ai-1.onrender.com/api
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://learnhub-ai-1.onrender.com
